      "created_at": "2015-10-29T17:45:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As well as the Steam version you could also always just set up a chat with someone (voice or text, either would work) and play that way, with your deck set up on your computer desk (if you have space) or on a nearby table or something. And whichever of you is running the villain/environment can do that too, and everyone can post up what cards they currently have in play and the hp of various targets and stuff like that :). There used to be games run by forum members over the Google meet-ups thingy, but I don't know if that's still a thing.</p><p>Oh yeah, welcome btw :).</p>",
